Depends: libc6 (>= 2.39), libgcc-s1, libstdc++6, libdbus-1-3, libfontconfig1, libxkbcommon0, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libx11-6, libx11-xcb1, libxcb1, libxcursor1, libxi6, libxrandr2, libwayland-client0, libwayland-cursor0, libwayland-egl1, libegl1, libgl1, bluez, xdg-desktop-portal
Description: Control Soundcore Bluetooth headphones and speakers
 OpenSCL4 provides device settings, equalizer profiles and quick presets.
 It is based on OpenSCQ30 and uses a shared Rust device library.
